{"aggregate_id": "01M3H10APAG3B9VS6DMZDM1S2F", "aggregate_type": "Mission", "event_id": "01M3H10C99C98YAMPYMPBEJK66", "event_type": "MissionCreated", "payload": {"actor": "noreply@anthropic.com", "created_at": "2026-09-27T08:51:47.108264+00:00", "friendly_name": "Issue-Matrix Partition Read Integrity & Merge Verdict-Terminality", "mission_id": "01M3H10APAG3B9VS6DMZDM1S2F", "mission_number": null, "mission_slug": "issue-matrix-partition-integrity-01M3H10A", "mission_type": "software-dev", "purpose_context": "On coordination-topology missions the authored issue-matrix verdicts live on the coordination branch, but several gates read the primary working-tree copy (stale residue): mission-review reports a false hard FAIL (#5171) and the merge gate finds nothing to enforce and lands a false PASS (#4943). Separately, merge records work packages done without applying the in-mission -> done terminal-verdict rule that only move-task enforces, so a mission can land with an unresolved verdict on record (#4943, second leg). This mission closes the partition-resolution class at every consumer and makes merge honor terminal verdicts, so the mission ledger a team relies on is trustworthy.", "purpose_tldr": "Make issue-matrix gates resolve the coordination partition (and the coord branch ref post-consolidation) so coord-topology missions stop getting false review FAILs and false merge PASSes, and make merge enforce terminal issue verdicts.", "target_branch": "claude/spec-kitty-ci-failures-r0xui3", "wp_count": 0}, "project_slug": "spec-kitty", "project_uuid": "8a4a7da6-a97c-4bb4-893a-b31664abfee4", "schema_version": "5.0.0", "timestamp": "2026-09-27T08:51:47.113723+00:00"}
